INTERPRETATION (R32):
- Atomic knowledge is perfectly in weights (single-step 1.0 all views), yet latent no-CoT 2-hop
  composition to held-out endpoints is exactly 0.0. Direct 2-hop supervision memorizes trained
  pairs (train-fit 1.0) but yields 0.0 on held-out chains -> no general composition operator.
- This is the two-hop curse / OOD compositionality gap: latent multi-hop to held-out entities does
  not generalize at 0.5B / this budget. Both A and B FAIL.
- CONSEQUENCE: cross-stream *latent held-out* composition is NOT a viable stressor to justify
  growth at this scale — the upper bound itself scores 0, so grow-vs-fixed arms would be
  uninterpretable. The gate prevented an unattributable 0-vs-0 experiment (its intended job).
- This closes the latent-composition avenue much like R31 closed the fact-count avenue.
- OPEN next: (a) IN-DISTRIBUTION grokking regime (atomic facts of held-out (A,C) still seen;
  composition query held out) — literature says this DOES grok in-distribution; test whether
  depth/growth changes grokking onset/ceiling (reachable growth-necessity test); or
  (b) CoT/scratchpad composition; or (c) accept honest bottom line = knowledge-into-weights via
  replay (R25/R30), growth still unjustified.
